{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A meteor struck the world, bringing with it a cataclysmic disaster while bestowing magical powers upon the survivors. Just as humanity became intoxicated by this new power, monsters of various forms emerged without warning, ravaging the globe and trampling all life. Suddenly, like the fall of the meteor, despair once again enveloped the earth. To resist these monsters and reclaim their homeland, tribes from all around the world selected the strongest warriors to launch a desperate counterattack against these creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game controls are very simple: W: Move up, A: Move left, S: Move down, D: Move right, SPACE: Release skill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features two modes: Entertainment Mode and Challenge Mode. Entertainment Mode is suitable for players who simply want to experience the thrill of defeating large numbers of monsters, while Challenge Mode is designed for those looking to test their skills against the game's difficulty. Additionally, the game includes a skill system with both pure damage skills and support skills, which play a more significant role in Challenge Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u00a0Casual Mode: Items and maps have no debuff effects, and monster types appear in fixed sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u00a0Challenge Mode: Items and maps have debuffs. Monster types per wave are randomized. The final wave lasts 160 seconds with continuously strengthening monsters. Skill cooldown is increased to 15 seconds. Players must survive the entire 160-second phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can choose from the following character classes: Monk, Pirate, Knight, Mage, Thief, Taoist, Shaman, Samurai, and Hunter, each with their own innate abilities.</strong><br><br><strong>Weapon types include: sword, hammer, axe, bow, spear, magic staff, and dagger, totaling 27 types, each with different attack effects. There are also 20 skills to assist in combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874760/extras/ec9aa3bfbe1b1365537bc7239ddecc87.avif?t=1754114018\" width=800 height=449 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874760/extras/aeeadc678db055dcfb423ea0e03d1ee3.avif?t=1754114018\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/4eaa9f45c6cc286053b1aa91aa496ba0a9bb4073.jpg"},{"name":"Blade Unity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/c09942d1dcc65eca88a060990945b99828f62541.jpg"},{"name":"World Cleaver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/cec810428bd23a0de78cb38821475c392efba8e8.jpg"},{"name":"Elemental Resonance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/dc010968950e33cddd5ccee0cc7a8560af92eac3.jpg"},{"name":"No Retreat No Surrender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/42a7a04e129e05a497cd183e7b1e2550518906f5.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/1ef8596b9982fd7ef1147d5468745142d21323ce.jpg"},{"name":"Earth shaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/634c86b3b23704661beaf3ed5a39ee400c1dae2a.jpg"},{"name":"Deathblow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874760/6893f5d2407a84dcc4e